    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ⚙️ Adjust to Cloud Station's real payload\nThese paths assume a Meta Cloud API-style body: `entry[0].changes[0].value.messages[0]...`. Send yourself one test WhatsApp message, open this node's input in n8n, and check the ACTUAL field names Cloud Station sends — then fix these 3 expressions (`sessionId`, `customerName`, `message`) and the 'Is Text Message?' condition above to match. This is the one part of the workflow tied to your specific provider.",
